    "commit_body": "On bearish setups (pre_regime < 50), blend regime multiplier as\n75% composite + 25% SPY weekly composite to suppress false put\nsignals on market recovery days before VIX/breadth fully normalize.\nCalls always use unmodified composite. Validated: put <15 WR15 +0.7pp,\ncall 70+ WR15 unchanged. Applied in scoring, daily update, and\nfull recalculate paths (calculate_scores_batched,\nrecalculate_scores_batched, recalculate_scores_full, reapply_regime_today).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
